{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":18,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 18:1"},"Through desire a man, having separated himself, seeketh ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and "]},"intermeddleth with all wisdom. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 18:2"},"A fool hath no delight in understanding, but that his heart may discover itself. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 18:3"},"When the wicked cometh, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["then"]}," cometh also contempt, and with ignominy reproach. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 18:4"},"The words of a man’s mouth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are as"]}," deep waters, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and "]},"the wellspring of wisdom ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," a flowing brook. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 18:5"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," not good to accept the person of the wicked, to overthrow the righteous in judgment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 18:6"},"A fool’s lips enter into contention, and his mouth calleth for strokes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 18:7"},"A fool’s mouth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his destruction, and his lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are "]},"the snare of his soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 18:8"},"The words of a talebearer ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," as wounds, and they go down into the innermost parts of the belly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 18:9"},"He also that is slothful in his work is brother to him that is a great waster. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 18:10"},"The name of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a strong tower: the righteous runneth into it, and is safe. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 18:11"},"The rich man’s wealth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his strong city, and as an high wall in his own conceit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 18:12"},"Before destruction the heart of man is haughty, and before honour ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," humility. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 18:13"},"He that answereth a matter before he heareth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it,"]}," it ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," folly and shame unto him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 18:14"},"The spirit of a man will sustain his infirmity; but a wounded spirit who can bear? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 18:15"},"The heart of the prudent getteth knowledge; and the ear of the wise seeketh knowledge. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 18:16"},"A man’s gift maketh room for him, and bringeth him before great men. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 18:17"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["He that is"]}," first in his own cause ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["seemeth"]}," just; but his neighbour cometh and searcheth him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 18:18"},"The lot causeth contentions to cease, and parteth between the mighty. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 18:19"},"A brother offended ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is harder to be won"]}," than a strong city: and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["their"]}," contentions ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," like the bars of a castle. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 18:20"},"A man’s belly shall be satisfied with the fruit of his mouth; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," with the increase of his lips shall he be filled. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 18:21"},"Death and life ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," in the power of the tongue: and they that love it shall eat the fruit thereof. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 18:22"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Whoso"]}," findeth a wife findeth a good ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["thing,"]}," and obtaineth favour of the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 18:23"},"The poor useth intreaties; but the rich answereth roughly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 18:24"},"A man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that hath"]}," friends must shew himself friendly: and there is a friend ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," sticketh closer than a brother. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 18:24"}]}]}
